cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MERIDIAN Grid in research or teaching, please cite it as below."

title: "MERIDIAN Grid: Real-Data EU Power Grid Simulator"
abstract: >
  An open, interactive DC load-flow simulator of the European interconnected
  power system covering 40 bidding zones, 62 AC interconnectors, and 21 HVDC
  cables across all four synchronous areas. Fed by real-time ENTSO-E data and
  calibrated against physically measured cross-border flows (A11). Includes
  an AI-powered learning mode, N-1 contingency analysis, and quasi-stationary
  frequency simulation.

version: "2.0"
date-released: "2025-07-25"
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/raschott5-prog/meridian-eu-grid"
